## 8.4 Consolidated Indexing Strategy

Ringkasan penerapan DBS-015 lintas domain:

| Pola Indeks                          | Contoh Tabel                          | Tujuan                                   |
| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| `(organization_id, code)` UNIQUE     | organization, party, item, account    | Keunikan kode ber-scope.                 |
| `(organization_id, fiscal_period_id)`| journal_entry, account_balance        | Query periodik ber-scope.                |
| FK index                             | seluruh `*_id` join columns           | Kinerja join intra-layanan.              |
| Partial `WHERE deleted_at IS NULL`   | master & transaksi ber-soft-delete    | Efisiensi query data aktif.              |
| BRIN pada kolom waktu                 | stock_movement, audit_log, journal    | Time-series besar berpartisi.            |
| GIN pada JSONB                        | posting_rule, workflow_step, param    | Query atribut fleksibel.                 |
| Unique dokumen                        | journal_no, invoice_no, po_no, so_no  | Keunikan nomor dokumen.                  |

